{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志下","commonName":"历代志下","title":"历代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"686ce221582f699b247061de865d425af7f7a8470b8e24b68b4cadccf8f25efa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":818},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["建造圣殿"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所罗门在耶路撒冷的摩利亚山上动工兴建耶和华的殿，殿址在耶布斯人阿珥楠的麦场，就是大卫指定的地方。耶和华曾在那里向他父亲大卫显现。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["所罗门在执政第四年二月二日动工建殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["按照古时的尺度，他建造的上帝殿宇的地基长二十七米，宽九米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["殿前的门廊长九米，与殿的宽度一样，高九米",{"noteId":1},"，里面都贴上纯金。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大殿里镶上松木板，贴上纯金，又刻上棕树和链子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所罗门用宝石和巴瓦音的纯金装饰圣殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["殿的栋梁、墙壁、门槛和门扇也都贴上金子；墙上还刻上基路伯天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所罗门又动工建造至圣所，长九米，宽九米，与殿的宽度一样，里面共贴了四十二万两纯金。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["所用的金钉重十二两。楼房也都贴上了金子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他又在至圣所制造两个基路伯天使，包上金子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["两个基路伯天使的翅膀共九米长，每个翅膀长两米二。两个基路伯天使面向殿站立，他们展开的翅膀共九米长，各有一个翅膀触到殿墙，一个翅膀互相连接。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他用细麻和蓝色、紫色、朱红色毛线织成幔子，上面绣上基路伯天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["所罗门在殿前造了两根柱子，每根高八米，上面的柱冠高两米二。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他造了链子",{"noteId":2},"，装饰在柱冠上。他又造了一百个石榴，安在链子上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他把两根柱子一南一北立在殿前，南边那根称为雅斤，北边那根称为波阿斯。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“高九米”希伯来文是“高五十四米”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"“他造了链子”希伯来文是“他在圣所内造了链子”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}